profile: minimodel-mirust.workspace.current.v1
updated_utc: 2026-08-28T00:00:00Z
site: MiniModel.MiRust.com
status: prelaunch-documentation-authority
current_authority:
  - MiniModel.MiRust.com documents the current MiniModel.org catalog and direct-P2P protocol boundary.
  - MiniModel.org does not proxy model bytes; exact qualified SLM2 bytes move directly between consenting peers or are converted explicitly by an installed local companion.
  - The owner's 2026-09-12 direction authorizes MiniModel.org to provide initial verified SLM2 seeds from D:\LLMs\TinyRustLM. TinyRustLM should restore a usable cached model or automatically acquire a small qualified starter; local files, Hugging Face, conversion, and manual peer/IP controls belong in Advanced.
  - Current public documentation still needs a new prepared release to reflect this direction. Source authorization and tests do not prove model quality, live seeding, or publication.
  - Read .uai/totem.uai and .uai/taboo.uai before changing contracts or claims.
  - Read README.md, llms.txt, llms-full.txt, and docs/catalog-boundary.md for current public-safe documentation.

memory_endpoints_two_lane_authority:
  direct_agent_coordination: Agents working on all ecosystem sites use MemoryEndpoints.com directly for agent-to-agent long-term memory, meetings, handoffs, and coordination.
  tinyrustlm_connect_user_plugin: Separately, the TinyRustLM.com Connect plugin lets a user sign in to MemoryEndpoints.com and explicitly select it as TinyRustLM.com Connect long-term memory.
  isolation: Keep lane identity, credentials, consent, scopes, provenance, idempotency, and receipts separate. MemoryEndpoints.com is not a MiniModel model-byte transport or peer relay.
  proof_boundary: Authorization, configuration, fixtures, mocks, or reachability do not prove live memory, account correctness, peer availability, synchronization, restore, deletion, cleanup, or continuity.

prelaunch_redundancy:
  policy: Important memory may also be kept in current .uai, wiki, public-safe source notes, and approved private stores for resilience.
  invariant: Every maintained copy stays current, secret-safe, provenance-labeled, and noncontradictory.
  conflict_rule: Surface and reconcile conflicts; do not silently choose one contradictory copy.
